      "content": "That makes sense. I suspected there might be some external pressure. However, I'm specifically worried about the personal relationship between the two department heads themselves. In your one-on-one feedback sessions, did either of them say anything about the other person's character or leadership style? I need to be 100% sure there isn't an underlying resentment that's going to blow up this agreement later.",
